	// On top of that, categories the admin muted are excluded from all three - the badge
	// is counted here, so a mute the count didn't honour would be a badge that lies
	// COALESCE, because an empty mute list arrives as NULL and `= ANY(NULL)` is NULL, so
	// NOT of it drops every row - "nothing muted" would have emptied the whole inbox
	// Idempotent: dedupe_key collapses repeat events / re-scans of the same
	// condition - RETURNING feeds the live-push fan-out; a dedupe hit returns no
	// row (sql.ErrNoRows), which the service treats as "already notified"
